ld have to say that the game was a bit on th easy side or perhaps I should play it on hard mode.\n\nThe game has a fair amount off comedy, emotion, and grit, but none off them are exceptional.  I really enjoyed kickin butt and mixing up melee combat with shooting. I'd recommend this to anyone who loves straight up action games without the need to learn complex ideas/controls.  I'd play it again if I didn't have so many games to play.", "timestamp_created": 1361361695, "timestamp_updated": 1361361695, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.53600001335144043", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "4974434", "author": {"steamid": "76561198043867600", "personaname": "nuadarstark", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198043867600/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 1798, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1710, "last_played": 1431205183, "avatar": "144f1bb349a9be8d0a7cfe1fb0581d00f89faeff"}, "language": "english", "review": "Surprisingly solid game with solid mechanics and nice looks. Campaign is pretty daft but what shines in this 3rd person shooter is its incredible multiplayer.", "timestamp_created": 1361274624, "timestamp_updated": 1418470783, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "302534", "author": {"steamid": "76561197968141956", "personaname": "Ndyin", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ndyin/", "num_games_owned": 207, "num_reviews"